    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9858" root="خبث" body-key="x">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبَتَ ذِكْرُهُ</span></b>  <i>The mention of him,</i> or <i>it, was,</i>
or <i>became, concealed:</i> (L:) [app. meaning <i>he,</i> or
<i>it, was,</i> or <i>became, obscure;</i> or <i>of no reputation,</i>
or <i>repute.</i>] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبُثَ</span>, accord. to Z, <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبُثَ</span>
[q. v.]: occurring in a trad. (TA.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبِيتٌ</span>.]

